# Sellerpool (Селлерпул)

Clean-room analytics platform: Data → Dashboards → AI insights → benchmark pool. Not BoostixERP.

## Monorepo layout

- `apps/api` — Fastify backend (`@sellerpool/api`)
- `apps/studio` — React SPA (`@sellerpool/studio`, `@/` alias)
- `packages/core` — shared Zod schemas + `buildWidgetQuery` (`@sellerpool/core`)
- `packages/insights` — anomaly detection + LLM evaluator (`@sellerpool/insights`)
- `cube/` — Cube.js config; models in `model/cubes/`

## Commands

Use `npx pnpm@9.15.4` (not global pnpm). Run `typecheck` and `lint` after changes.

## Code style

- ESM (`"type": "module"`)
- Minimal focused diffs; no drive-by refactors
- User-facing UI text in Russian; product brand Sellerpool / Селлерпул
- API errors as `{ error: string }` or Better Auth format

## Do not

- Copy code from BoostixERP or other employer projects
- Commit without explicit user request
- Run `db:push` or DB mutations without approval
- Add README/docs unless asked
